# Talisman allowlist — all entries are LOW-severity word-match false positives
# (ordinary source/docs mentioning the word "key", ".env.example filename
# pattern, etc). Real secrets live in .env, which is git-ignored.
# Regenerate with: ~/.talisman/bin/talisman_darwin_arm64 --checksum=<file>
